# PowerShell Logging Disabled Via Registry Key Tampering | T1112, T1564.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_powershell_logging_disabled.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13 (TargetObject IN ("*\\Microsoft\\Windows\\PowerShell\\*", "*\\Microsoft\\PowerShellCore\\*")) (TargetObject IN ("*\\ModuleLogging\\EnableModuleLogging", "*\\ScriptBlockLogging\\EnableScriptBlockLogging", "*\\ScriptBlockLogging\\EnableScriptBlockInvocationLogging", "*\\Transcription\\EnableTranscripting", "*\\Transcription\\EnableInvocationHeader", "*\\EnableScripts")) Details="DWORD (0x00000000)"
